            "Check and save": [
                "Kontrol et ve kaydet"
            ],
            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "Bir e-posta listesi hizmetini bir kez ba\u011flay\u0131n; ard\u0131ndan herhangi bir form, onu dolduran ki\u015fileri listelerinizden birine ekleyebilir (form blo\u011fu ayarlar\u0131 \u2192 G\u00f6nderimden sonra). Anahtarlar hizmetle kontrol edilir, bu sitede \u015fifrelenmi\u015f olarak saklan\u0131r ve bir daha asla g\u00f6sterilmez."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "Form g\u00f6nderimlerini ve d\u00fc\u011fme t\u0131klamalar\u0131n\u0131 kodsuz bir \u015fekilde analizlerinize g\u00f6nderin. O hizmeti atlamak i\u00e7in bir kimli\u011fi bo\u015f b\u0131rak\u0131n. D\u00fc\u011fmeler, Geli\u015fmi\u015f panelinde bir \"D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm etkinli\u011fi\" alan\u0131 al\u0131r. \u00c7erez bildirimi a\u00e7\u0131kken, ziyaret\u00e7i kabul edene kadar hi\u00e7bir \u015fey y\u00fcklenmez."
            ],
            "Google Analytics 4 measurement ID": [
                "Google Analytics 4 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm kimli\u011fi"
            ],
            "Google Tag Manager container ID": [
                "Google Tag Manager kapsay\u0131c\u0131 kimli\u011fi"
            ],
            "Meta Pixel ID (the number shown in Meta Events Manager)": [
                "Meta Pixel Kimli\u011fi (Meta Olay Y\u00f6neticisi'nde g\u00f6sterilen numara)"
            ],
            "Load these tags on my site": [
                "Bu etiketleri siteme y\u00fckleyin"
            ],
            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "Teman\u0131z veya ba\u015fka bir eklenti bunlar\u0131 zaten ekliyorsa kapat\u0131n; etkinlikler yine de g\u00f6nderilir."
            ],
            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "Form g\u00f6nderimleri i\u00e7in etkinlik ad\u0131"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "Afi\u015f, bloklarla tasarlad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z bir a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r penceredir. D\u00fc\u011fmeleri #consent-accept, #consent-reject ve #consent-save ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131na y\u00f6nlendirir (\"save\" i\u00e7in analytics ve marketing adl\u0131 onay kutular\u0131yla birlikte); herhangi bir yerdeki #consent-open ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 afi\u015fi tekrar g\u00f6sterir. Bir ziyaret\u00e7i kabul edene kadar izleme etiketleri y\u00fcklenmez, Google Consent Mode \"denied\" olarak kal\u0131r ve listeledi\u011finiz betikler kapal\u0131 kal\u0131r."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
                "Haz\u0131r bir banner olu\u015fturun"
            ],
            "Show a cookie banner": [
                "Bir \u00e7erez ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6ster"
            ],
            "Banner": [
                "Afi\u015f"
            ],
            "Choose a popup\u2026": [
                "Bir a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r pencere se\u00e7in\u2026"
            ],
            "%s (draft)": [
                "%s (taslak)"
            ],
            "Edit the banner": [
                "Afi\u015fi d\u00fczenleyin"
            ],
            "Remember the choice for (days)": [
                "Se\u00e7imi (g\u00fcn) boyunca hat\u0131rla"
            ],
            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "Avrupa Birli\u011fi, AEA ve Birle\u015fik Krall\u0131k d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda: ziyaret\u00e7i reddedene kadar takibi y\u00fckleyin"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "Kapal\u0131: Her ziyaret\u00e7i \u00f6nce onay vermelidir (en kat\u0131 kural ve varsay\u0131lan). A\u00e7\u0131k: Yaln\u0131zca bar\u0131nd\u0131rma sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131n\u0131z veya CDN'iniz ziyaret\u00e7inin \u00fclkesini bildirdi\u011finde (\u00f6rne\u011fin Cloudflare'in CF-IPCountry ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131) ve bu \u00fclke EU, AEA, Birle\u015fik Krall\u0131k ve \u0130svi\u00e7re d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaysa ge\u00e7erlidir. Ba\u015fl\u0131k yine de g\u00f6sterilir ve bilinmeyen bir \u00fclke EU i\u00e7indeymi\u015f gibi de\u011ferlendirilir."
            ],
            "Other scripts to hold until consent (handle:analytics or handle:marketing, comma separated)": [
                "Onay verilene kadar bekletilecek di\u011fer komut dosyalar\u0131 (handle:analytics veya handle:marketing, virg\u00fclle ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015f)"
            ],
